      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "“If a man entices a virgin who isn’t pledged to be married, and lies with her, he shall surely pay a dowry for her to be his wife.",
      "ko": "사람이 정혼하지 아니한 처녀를 꾀어 동침하였으면 빙폐를 드려 아내로 삼을 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "458f3eed64a24b0e87c950f82582a40d43cf0d9a34892f3cc5064338defa109d",
      "translation_text_hash": "67278350162277148730c1b4a7d96cec0a8b865d47503bc39a15418b2f16161b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사람이 정혼하지 아니한 처녀를 꾀어 동침하였으면 빙폐를 드려 아내로 삼을 것이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "67278350162277148730c1b4a7d96cec0a8b865d47503bc39a15418b2f16161b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EXO:22:17",
      "sequence": 2131,
