      "en": "“He who sacrifices to any god, except to the LORD only, shall be utterly destroyed.",
      "ko": "여호와 외에 다른 신에게 희생을 드리는 자는 멸할찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6fdc012ddfb43b634499c75c5a7c323497c1edc38e5dae10c886f5352954a246",
      "translation_text_hash": "132ac71074a156b92f7c4739478c5f559d975edf9fbc1e9a4db1e4e91272cb2c",
